- Yes.

00:10:44.293 --> 00:10:47.737
- So from Sadia, how do you
encourage elementary kids?

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.157
- Yeah, so that's--

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.540
When we put out these,

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:57.570
we're gonna hopefully
by Monday or Tuesday,

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:59.117
