00:10:59.117 --> 00:11:00.500
"Okay, if I have an elementary school."

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.050
Let's say that I have a
seven-year old, eight-year old.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.980
What could the day look
like for that student?

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:06.790
And, it's gonna have
something like wake up,

